  "headline": "Prabowo Subianto Delivers Aid To Baduy Luar Fire Victims",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Subianto Delivers Aid To Baduy Luar Fire Victims",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto has provided 90 tons of rice to residents of Baduy Luar whose homes were destroyed in a recent devastating settlement fire.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto donated 90 tons of rice to support residents affected by the fire in Kampung Cipaler 2.",
    "The Banten Provincial Government is actively distributing emergency logistics to aid the displaced community members.",
    "The blaze destroyed dozens of traditional homes and rice barns in the Baduy Luar settlement area."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "A major fire recently swept through the Baduy Luar indigenous settlement in Banten, destroying dozens of homes and communal rice storage facilities. The incident has left numerous families displaced and in need of immediate assistance. In response to the crisis, the Indonesian government has mobilized relief efforts. President Prabowo Subianto personally directed the distribution of 90 tons of rice to the affected population in Kampung Cipaler 2, Desa Kanekes. Simultaneously, the Banten Provincial Government has deployed emergency logistical support to address the basic needs of the victims. Regional authorities have instructed various local government agencies to coordinate in providing aid and assistance to the indigenous community during this recovery period. The event has drawn significant attention from national media outlets as recovery efforts continue for the impacted residents.",
